Example records (examples/)
---------------------------

hairpin_dna_18      18-nt DNA hairpin GCGTTGCTTCTCCAACGC from the oxDNA distribution,
                    examples/HAIRPIN (GPL-3.0).
R10D_dna_256        256-nt DNA nanostructure R10D, selected for cellular uptake.
                    Rajwar A, Eichhorn L, Palacka J, Ly S, Benson E (2026). Iterative
                    Selection of DNA Nanostructures for Cellular Uptake. Adv Mater e74852.
                    doi:10.1002/adma.74852
three_way_dna_54_given
                    54-nt DNA three-way junction designed for this project, given with its
                    designed target structure (examples_given.db).
trna_phe_rna_76     Yeast tRNA-Phe, sequence of PDB entry 1EHZ.
                    Shi H, Moore PB (2000). The crystal structure of yeast phenylalanine
                    tRNA at 1.93 A resolution: a classic structure revisited.
                    RNA 6(8):1091-1105. doi:10.1017/s1355838200000364
add_riboswitch_rna_71
                    Adenine riboswitch aptamer (Vibrio vulnificus add), sequence of PDB
                    entry 1Y26.
                    Serganov A, Yuan YR, Pikovskaya O, et al. (2004). Structural basis for
                    discriminative regulation of gene expression by adenine- and
                    guanine-sensing mRNAs. Chem Biol 11(12):1729-1741.
                    doi:10.1016/j.chembiol.2004.11.018

